        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Drain Life"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen the wraith damages a living creature with its spectral hand Strike, the wraith gains 5 temporary Hit Points and the creature must succeed at a DC 23 Fortitude save or become drained 1. Further damage dealt by the wraith increases the amount of drain by 1 on a failed save to a maximum of drained 4."
            },
            "id": "0183f54b-3d93-4153-bb18-5482429c15a3",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:25.944969"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Wraith Spawn"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nA living humanoid slain by a wraith's spectral hand Strike rises as a wraith spawn after 1d4 rounds. This wraith spawn is under the command of the wraith that killed it. It doesn't have drain life or wraith spawn and becomes clumsy 2 for as long as it is a wraith spawn. If the creator of the wraith spawn dies, the wraith spawn becomes a full-fledged, autonomous wraith; it regains its free will, gains Wraith Spawn, and is no longer clumsy."
            },
            "id": "8dd1cf31-fc38-4b24-af01-b2a0464f6f9f",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:25.944969"
            }
          }
        }
